.ax-legend__note {
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 72ch;
  font-family: var(--rp-font-body);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--cp-ink-faint);
}
```

Rain gauge:

```css
.ax-gauge {
  --ax-band: var(--cp-band-clear);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  ...
}
```
Hmm layout: vertical card: pct, count, svg, face, scenario stacked centered:

```css
